{"id":"n63278-2-7","stage":2,"title":"늦추다 · 推迟","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63278-2-7-1","ko":"네 시계가 오 분 정도 빠른데?","zh":"你的手表快了大概五分钟吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네","meaning":"你的（너의 的缩略）","explanation":"너：你；의：的。네 是 너의 的缩略，修饰后面的名词，表示“你的”；这里不是数词四。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"시계가","meaning":"钟，表","explanation":"시계：钟，表；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시계","audio":"/audio/a658dc1b94077c9f96de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30190","senseId":"1","lemma":"시계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시계가","audio":"/audio/5436ad1287684e9bc00a.mp3"}},{"text":"오","meaning":"五","explanation":"오：五。","readings":[{"term":"오","audio":"/audio/c0ccf82e09f1e8734531.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31635","senseId":"1","lemma":"오","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오","audio":"/audio/c0ccf82e09f1e8734531.mp3"}},{"text":"분","meaning":"分，分钟","explanation":"분：分，分钟。","readings":[{"term":"분","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70891","senseId":"1","lemma":"분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"분","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3"}},{"text":"정도","meaning":"左右","explanation":"정도：左右。","readings":[{"term":"정도","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70876","senseId":"3","lemma":"정도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정도","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3"}},{"text":"빠른데?","meaning":"早","explanation":"빠르다：早；ㄴ데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"빠르다","audio":"/audio/904de91feaff572f721f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68755","senseId":"4","lemma":"빠르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceR